cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization in your work, please cite it as the software artifact and cite the paper it formalizes."
title: "FormalProof: a Lean 4 + mathlib formalization project for coding-theory papers"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 + mathlib formalization of the definitions and main theorems of a
  coding-theory paper, following the layout, documentation and verification
  conventions of Shenghao Yang's n4code_lean_dev project.  Includes a
  paper-to-Lean notation dictionary and consistency checkers.
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: ""
    # TODO: fill in your full name as it should appear in citations
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - interactive theorem proving
  - coding theory
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-09-12"
